    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Linyasio lietsisiche",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI yamusunjila Musa ari Yinjila ewaFarao; okhuba enyumiye omwoyokwe nende emioyo chiabasumbabe, mbu mana endolosie ebilolelo bianje bino hakari wabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi mbu oboole omwanawo nahulila, khandi omwitsukhuluwo nahulila, shinga olwa ndayingoyiye Misiri, nende ebilolelo bianje ebia ndakholile mubo; mbu mana mumanye shinga olwa endi OMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa nende Haruni nibeenjila ewaFarao, nibamusunjila bari Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabaHeburania, asunga; mbu Olakhayanga okhwituutuyia imbeli wanje okhuula liina? Lekhuula abandu banje batsie, mbu bakhalabanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa, noba nokhaya okhulekhuula abandu banje batsie, lola, mukamba ndalaleera tsisiche mushialoshlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natsio tsilamaamila eshibala shiosi, omundu naranyala okhulola eshibala ta; ne tsilaha omusikalo okweehonokokha, okwamutong'ela inyuma weifula yamachina, nitsilia buli musaala okwamumelela mumikunda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsinzutsio natsio tsileetsula, nende tsinzu tsiabasumbabo bosi, nende tsinzu tsiabaMisiri bosi; etsia abaso baralolakhwo kata abakuukabo ta, okhurula khunyanga olwa beenjila mushialo okhuula olwa leelo. Mana nashiukhana, narula ewaFarao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasumba baFarao nabo nibamusunjila bari Omundu uno alabeetsanga omubero khwifwe okhuula liina? Lekhuula abandu abo batsie, bamukhalabanile OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe; orashiamanya shinga Misiri olwa shimalile okhukora ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa nende Haruni baleerwa khandi ewaFarao; naye nabasunjila ari Tsie, mumukhalabanile OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe; ne nibanga wina abanabatsie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nasunga mbu Khulatsia nende abayia beefwe nabakofu beefwe, nende abaana beefwe abasiani nabaana beefwe abakhaana, nende ebiayo bieefwe netsing'ombe tsieefwe, khulatsia ninabio; okhuba khukhoyile okhukholela OMWAMI lisabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabasunjila ari Kho OMWAMI akhamale abe nineenywe, isie nimba nimulekhuula halala nende orwana rweenywe; mukheerecheshe; okhuba obubii nibwoobwamuchoomilekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawe; inywe abasaatsa mutsie, mumukhalabanile OMWAMI; okhuba niko aka mwenya. Mana nibeelusibwa imbeli waFarao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namusunjila Musa mbu Nyiila omukhonokwo hekulu khushialo shiaMisiri khulwa tsisiche, mbu tsitikulushile eshialo shiaMisiri, tsilie ebiraache biosi bieshialo, mbu biosi ebia ifula yamachina yalekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nachinguula indabushiye hekulu khushialo shiaMisiri, naye OMWAMI narusia omuyeka ebukwe khushialo eshiteere eshio tulu nende eshilo tulu; ne olwa bwashia mutsuli, omuyeka kwebukwe kwaleera tsisiche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natsio tsisiche nitsitikulukha khushialo shiosi shiaMisiri, nitsiyeela mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri; tsiali tsimbii muno; tsiali nitsishili okhubaho tsisiche shinga etsio, kata shitsilibaho inyuma watsio tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba tsiamaamila eshialo shiosi pe, eshibala nashio nishimalihanatsio nitsilia ebiraache biosi bieshialo, nende ebiamo biosi biemisaala ebia ifula yamachina yali niyileshile; nilirasikalaho kata lisaafu elala ta, kata emisaala kata ebiraache ebiomumikunda, mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Farao yarumana okhulanga Musa nende Haruni matetekhana; nasunga mbu Emwonooneele OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, halala nineenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano, ekhusaaya mbu undeshele eshionoono shianje lulala luno lwonyene, khandi omusaaye OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe mbu yambiniekhwo oluumbe luno lwonyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye narula ewaFarao, mana nasaaya OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye OMWAMI nashiukhasia omuyeka kwamumbo okwamaani muno, nakwo nikuhuutsa tsisiche tsana nikutsiyila muNyanza Inzakhanyu; niyiratong'aho isiche kata ndala tawe, mushialo shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa OMWAMI yatinyia omwoyo kwaFarao, Farao naye narabalekhuula abaana baIsiraeli ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Linyasio lteshiilima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI nasunjila Musa mbu Nyiila omukhonokwo ikulu, mbu mana eshiilima shibeho khushialo shiaMisiri, eshiilima eshimali titit'ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nanyiila omukhonokwe khwikulu; nishibaho eshiilima ti mushialo shiaMisiri tsindaalo tsitaru; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shibalolananga ta, kata omundu yesi shiyarula habunduwe mundaalo tsitaru etsio tawe; habula abaana baIsilaeli bosi bali nobulafu muhimenyo biabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Farao yarumana nalanga Musa, naboola ari Mutsie, mumukhalabanile OMWAMI; habula mbu ebiayo bieenywe nende tsing'ombe tsieenywe bisikale; abaana beenywe bo mutsie ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nasunga ari Okhuula okhuheelesie mumukhono ebiemisango chiosi halala nende echiokhusambwa, mbu khumumalile OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe emisango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiruko chieefwe nachio khulatsia ninachio; shikhulalekhakhwoho kata oluhakayu lulala inyuma weefwe ta; shichila khuchienechio nichio echia khukhoyile okhubukulakhwo, okhumukhalabanila OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe; kata shikhumanyile mbu nishiina eshia nakhumukhalabanile OMWAMI ninashio ta, okhuula olwa nakhube nikhuulileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa OMWAMI yatinyia omwoyo kwaFarao, Farao naye nakhaya okhubalekhuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
